      "blocks": {
        "question_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is MARCEL OMR Therapy™?",
            "answer": "<p>MARCEL OMR Therapy™ is a structured approach to oral mucosal care. It provides a planned framework for care rather than relying on random or inconsistent product use. The appropriate approach and products depend on the individual’s needs and the approved instructions for each product.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can MARCEL OMR Therapy™ help improve mouth opening?",
            "answer": "<p>Supporting oral comfort and function may be part of the care goal, but the amount of change in mouth opening varies from person to person. It depends on the degree of restriction, the individual’s condition and the care plan. A consultation with a MARCEL OSMF Consultant can help establish a baseline and discuss realistic goals.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will it completely cure OSMF or restore my mouth to how it was before?",
            "answer": "<p>A complete cure or a return to exactly the same mouth opening cannot be promised. The focus is to assess the condition, address symptoms and work toward the best achievable function for the individual. A qualified OSMF Specialist Doctor can explain the options after assessing the case.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is MARCEL OMR Therapy™ only for early-stage OSMF?",
            "answer": "<p>The care needed depends on the person’s symptoms, mouth opening and clinical findings, not simply on an assumed stage. People with more restricted mouth opening should be assessed to determine the appropriate plan and whether additional medical care is needed.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How soon will I notice a result?",
            "answer": "<p>There is no single timeline that applies to everyone. Burning, eating comfort and mouth opening are different outcomes and may change at different rates. Follow the recommended care plan and arrange a review if progress is not as expected.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need to use every component of the recommended care plan?",
            "answer": "<p>The components may serve different purposes, so do not assume that using one product alone will provide the same approach. Follow the care plan recommended for you and the approved instructions supplied with each product. If you are unsure what to use, ask the MARCEL OSMF Consultant before changing the plan.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
